<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="zh-TW">
  <p>W4 說過，名詞字尾可以把一個動作打包成一個東西。這是學術文章最常見的寫法。現在，我們用短文裡的字練習。</p>
  <p>先看一句：<lang xml:lang="en-US">The government decided to buy clean buses.</lang> 把 decided 打包成名詞，就變成 <lang xml:lang="en-US">The government's decision to buy clean buses changed the city.</lang> decision 變成了主詞，後面還可以再說它帶來什麼結果。</p>
  <p>再一句：<lang xml:lang="en-US">The smoke was reduced.</lang> 打包以後：<lang xml:lang="en-US">The reduction of smoke surprised everyone.</lang></p>
  <p>換你試試：<lang xml:lang="en-US">People became aware of the problem.</lang> <break time="5s"/>你可以寫成：<lang xml:lang="en-US">People's awareness of the problem grew.</lang> 或是 <lang xml:lang="en-US">Awareness of the problem helped the city change.</lang></p>
  <p>打包以後的句子不一定比較好讀，但它比較「學術」，因為它把事情變成可以討論、可以比較的東西。之後在學術讀寫課，你會一直用到這個技巧。</p>
</speak>
